Package: EarthFlux
Title: Land-Surface Energy and Water Fluxes from Earth Observation Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Guillermo Servando", "Fuentes-Jaque", , "gfuentesj@correo.uss.cl", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7864-4899"))
Description: Tools for estimating spatially distributed actual
    evapotranspiration from Earth observation data using the METRIC
    (Mapping EvapoTranspiration at high Resolution with Internalized
    Calibration) surface energy balance framework, combined with
    meteorological forcing that may vary in space, for example through
    geographically weighted regression (GWR). The package is designed for
    reproducible processing, diagnostics, validation and scientific
    analysis. It is under active development and its methods have not yet
    been scientifically validated.
