Config/github/description: EarthFlux: Land-Surface Energy and Water Fluxes from Earth Observation Data. R package for spatially distributed actual evapotranspiration with the METRIC surface energy balance, MODIS inputs and spatially varying weather forcing (GWR). Reproducible, tested and diagnostic-first; in active development.
